どんな祈りも言葉も 近づけるのに、届かなかった
No prayer, no words could reach you, close as they got.

305
00:44:44,582 --> 00:44:48,082
まるで、静かな恋のような
Just like a quiet love,

306
00:44:48,082 --> 00:44:51,582
頬を伝った夏のような色の中
amidst the summery colors running down my cheek,

307
00:44:51,582 --> 00:44:56,882
きみを呪う言葉がずっと喉の奥につかえてる
the words cursing you remain stuck deep in my throat.

308
00:44:56,882 --> 00:45:04,082
「また会えるよね」って、声にならない声
"We'll meet again, right?"—in a voiceless voice.

309
00:45:11,170 --> 00:45:16,770
昼下がり、じめつく風の季節は
On a humid afternoon, in the season of damp winds,

310
00:45:17,770 --> 00:45:23,470
想い馳せる、まだ何者でもなかった僕らの肖像
I reminisce about portraits of us when we were still nobodies.

311
00:45:23,970 --> 00:45:28,870
何もかも分かち合えたはずだった
We were supposed to be able to share everything.

312
00:45:28,970 --> 00:45:35,870
あの日から少しずつ きみと違う僕という呪いが肥っていく
Since that day, the curse of being different from you grew bit by bit.

313
00:45:47,870 --> 00:45:53,370
きみの笑顔の奥の憂いを
The sorrow deep within your smile—

314
00:45:53,870 --> 00:46:00,970
見落としたこと、悔やみ尽くして
I regret with all my heart having overlooked it.

315
00:46:07,870 --> 00:46:15,070
徒花と咲いて散っていくきみに さよなら
To you who bloom as a fruitless flower and scatter... goodbye.

316
00:46:15,570 --> 00:46:21,870
今でも青が棲んでいる 今でも青は澄んでいる
Even now, the blue still lives on. Even now, the blue remains clear.

317
00:46:22,170 --> 00:46:28,070
どんな祈りも言葉も 近づけるのに、届かなかった
No matter what prayers or words I spoke, I drew close, yet couldn't reach you.

318
00:46:28,270 --> 00:46:30,970
まるで、静かな恋のような
Just like a quiet love,

319
00:46:31,170 --> 00:46:35,070
頬を伝った夏のような色のなか
amidst colors like summer trickling down my cheek,

320
00:46:35,170 --> 00:46:40,070
きみを呪う言葉がずっと喉の奥につかえてる
words cursing you remain stuck deep in my throat.

321
00:46:40,370 --> 00:46:46,570
「また会えるよね」って、声にならない声
"We'll meet again, right?"—in a voiceless voice.

322
00:46:46,870 --> 00:46:51,870
無限に膨張する銀河の星の粒のように
Like grains of stars in an infinitely expanding galaxy,

323
00:46:52,070 --> 00:46:55,070
指の隙間を零れた
they slipped through the gaps in my fingers.

324
00:47:30,970 --> 00:47:36,570
はい！ということで、ここまで一気にノンストップでお送りしました！
Alright! So, we've delivered everything non-stop up to this point!

325
00:47:37,070 --> 00:47:42,070
いや、平成も令和も、いや名曲ばかりでしたね！
Wow, both the Heisei and Reiwa eras... it was non-stop classic hits, wasn't it?

326
00:47:42,370 --> 00:47:45,470
どうでしたか？好きな曲はありましたか？
How was it? Were there any songs you liked?

327
00:47:45,770 --> 00:47:50,070
そして、みんな、どっちのチームが良かったかな？
And everyone, which team do you think was better?

328
00:47:56,270 --> 00:48:02,670
このね、今、後ろのこのハートのステージね
You see this heart stage behind me right now?

329
00:48:02,870 --> 00:48:12,070
はい、こちらのハートに映し出された色で、どっちのチームが勝ったのか決まります！
Yes! The color displayed on this heart will decide which team won!

330
00:48:12,270 --> 00:48:15,870
ぜひみんなコメントでどっちが良かったか教えてください！
Please let us know in the comments which team you thought was better!

331
00:48:16,270 --> 00:48:19,570
えぇー？決められない？
Ehh? You can't decide?

332
00:48:20,070 --> 00:48:25,070
いやいや、そこはね、ちょっとね、決めて... あ、すごい、この2色にね、分かれておりますけれども
No, no, you gotta choose... Oh wow, it's split cleanly into these two colors!

333
00:48:25,270 --> 00:48:28,270
しっかり決めていただかないと。
But you really need to pick one for us!

334
00:48:28,570 --> 00:48:33,870
はい、今日はね、あの平成VS令和となっております。
Yes, today is Heisei VS Reiwa!

335
00:48:35,870 --> 00:48:45,070
はい！ということで勝ったのは、平成赤チームか？それとも令和青チームか？
Alright! So who won? Was it the Heisei Red Team? Or the Reiwa Blue Team?

336
00:48:45,570 --> 00:48:50,070
一体どっちかな？それじゃあ行くよ？
Which one could it be? Alright, here we go!

337
00:48:50,370 --> 00:48:53,870
さあ、結果はこちら！
Now, here are the results!

338
00:48:59,870 --> 00:49:02,870
どっちかな？
Which team will it be?

339
00:49:04,570 --> 00:49:08,570
ん？え？なんか紫になっちゃったんですけど！
Huh? Wait, it turned purple?!

340
00:49:08,870 --> 00:49:12,070
紫って... 紫ってどっちですか？
Purple? What does purple mean?!

341
00:49:12,370 --> 00:49:17,870
うーん... もうこれは、あの赤チームも良かったし青チームも良かったということで...
Hmm... Well, I guess this means both the Red Team and Blue Team were so great...

342
00:49:18,070 --> 00:49:23,070
全てフュージョンして紫になってしまった！
...that everything fused together and turned purple!

343
00:49:23,270 --> 00:49:31,070
ということで、いやみんな、たくさん歌ったし、みんな最高だったってことにします！
So since everyone sang so much and did their best, let me just say everyone was amazing!

344
00:49:33,070 --> 00:49:43,070
いやなんか... みんなのおかげで、あ！なんかパワーが、パワーが溜まってきた気がするな！
I feel like... thanks to everyone, oh! I feel like power is building up inside me!

345
00:49:43,270 --> 00:49:45,070
気がする！
I can feel it!

346
00:49:53,270 --> 00:49:57,070
と言うことで、新衣装です！
And with that, here's my new outfit!

347
00:50:00,406 --> 00:50:02,206
ピントが全部
The focus is all...

348
00:50:02,206 --> 00:50:05,806
AZKiの魔力になっちゃった
...turned into AZKi's magic!

349
00:50:06,706 --> 00:50:08,906
見てください どうですか？
Please look! How is it?

350
00:50:09,706 --> 00:50:13,206
尻尾も 尻尾も生えてるんです
A tail... a tail grew, too!

351
00:50:13,406 --> 00:50:15,206
フリ フリ フリ フリ
*wag wag wag wag*

352
00:50:15,206 --> 00:50:16,606
どうですか？
How is it?

353
00:50:17,406 --> 00:50:24,506
はい ということで今回は 小悪魔衣装をお仕立ていただきました！
Yes! So this time, I had a little devil outfit tailored for me!

354
00:50:24,506 --> 00:50:27,206
どうでしょうか？ どうでしょうか？
What do you think? How is it?

355
00:50:27,206 --> 00:50:30,106
魔力 魔王...
Magic power, demon lord...

356
00:50:30,606 --> 00:50:32,206
小悪魔です
I'm a little devil!

357
00:50:32,906 --> 00:50:40,006
はい 今回ですね 新衣装は こちらの小悪魔衣装 可愛いでしょう？
Yes! This time, my new outfit is... this little devil outfit! Cute, right?

358
00:50:40,006 --> 00:50:41,506
今日たくさんスクショ撮ってくださいね！
Please take lots of screenshots today, okay?

359
00:50:41,506 --> 00:50:48,906
ということで この衣装でね せっかくなので アニソンを歌っていきたいなと思います！
So, since I'm wearing this outfit, I'd like to sing an anime song!

360
00:50:49,106 --> 00:50:58,406
もしかしたらね 小悪魔ですから この姿なら 魔法とかも使えちゃうんじゃないのかな？
Maybe, since I'm a little devil, in this form I can even use magic? Can I?

361
00:50:58,906 --> 00:51:05,906
ということで ではですね 次の曲 聴いてください！
So then... please listen to the next song!

362
00:51:13,306 --> 00:51:16,206
召喚ー！
Summoning~!

363
00:51:24,206 --> 00:51:28,506
自分の過去に囚われ迷って
Trapped in my past and lost,

364
00:51:28,906 --> 00:51:33,406
そうじゃないよと言い聞かせて 全てを
telling myself that's not true...

365
00:51:33,806 --> 00:51:39,006
自由にあやつれるかなんて
"Can I control everything freely?"

366
00:51:39,106 --> 00:51:43,806
分からないよと 空は霞んで 正解はどこ？
"I don't know," as the sky hazes over... Where is the answer?

367
00:51:44,306 --> 00:51:49,006
僕の手のひらに 残る大事なもの
The precious thing that remains in the palm of my hand,

368
00:51:49,506 --> 00:51:54,106
忘れない記憶 何度でも
an unforgettable memory... No matter how many times,

369
00:51:54,406 --> 00:51:59,406
君を守り抜くと叫んで
I'll scream that I will protect you to the end.

370
00:51:59,806 --> 00:52:04,406
巻き戻しの中 掴んだ愛はそう
The love I grasped within the rewind, yes,

371
00:52:04,906 --> 00:52:06,706
離しはしないから
I will never let it go.

372
00:52:07,206 --> 00:52:11,806
散りばめた思い 今一度きりの願いへ
Scattered feelings toward a one-time wish right now,

373
00:52:12,206 --> 00:52:16,706
次への僕に 託したよ
I entrusted to the future me.

374
00:52:17,006 --> 00:52:21,906
いつかの約束 光の道しるべになる
That promise someday will become a guiding light.

375
00:52:22,206 --> 00:52:33,306
誓いをさあ君のため 最期まで
A vow, now, for your sake, until the very end.

376
00:52:33,806 --> 00:52:41,206
涙さえ力に変えてきっと 描いていた望む未来へ 繋ぐよ
Turning even tears into strength, I will surely connect to the desired future I envisioned.

377
00:52:46,106 --> 00:52:50,906
想像を超える事態に 狂って
Driven mad by a situation beyond imagination,

378
00:52:51,306 --> 00:52:55,306
爪を立てては もがき足掻いて 心は
digging in my nails, struggling and squirming, my heart...

379
00:52:55,706 --> 00:53:00,706
人生の過ちをもう何回
How many times must I repeat...

380
00:53:01,106 --> 00:53:05,806
繰り返しては 嫌になって 泣いてても
...the mistakes of life, hating it and crying?

381
00:53:06,306 --> 00:53:11,006
君の憧れは いつも輝いてた
Your ideal was always shining.

382
00:53:11,406 --> 00:53:16,106
I'll come back To your future

383
00:53:16,606 --> 00:53:21,406
僕は抗うだろう 運命に
I will fight against destiny.

384
00:53:21,906 --> 00:53:27,806
Breaking out Breaking down

385
00:53:28,806 --> 00:53:32,506
諦めちゃいないから
Because I haven't given up!

386
00:53:33,906 --> 00:53:39,006
結ばれた意思は 独りきりじゃない強さへ
Bound determination leads toward a strength that isn't alone.

387
00:53:39,406 --> 00:53:43,806
紡いだ糸を 手繰り寄せ
Pulling in the spun thread,

388
00:53:44,106 --> 00:53:48,906
見つけた瞳は 理想を現実に変える
the eyes I found will turn ideals into reality.

389
00:53:49,306 --> 00:54:00,206
世界はそう君のため 最初から
Yes, the world is for your sake, right from the beginning.

390
00:54:00,706 --> 00:54:05,506
胸に抱いた思い出とずっと あの日から続く決意で
With the memories held in my heart and the resolve continuing from that day,

391
00:54:05,906 --> 00:54:09,706
飛べるよ Redo
I can fly! Redo!

392
00:54:10,506 --> 00:54:13,306
AZKiちゃん 生誕祭！ まだまだ行きますよー！
AZKi-chan's birthday concert! Let me hear you!

393
00:54:13,306 --> 00:54:15,606
盛り上がっていこうー！
Let's get fired up!

394
00:54:20,206 --> 00:54:24,506
君がたとえ僕のこと
Even if you...

395
00:54:24,906 --> 00:54:34,306
忘れても 僕はもう忘れない 誰も傷つけない
...forget about me, I won't forget anymore, I won't hurt anyone.

396
00:54:34,806 --> 00:54:39,406
消えそうな過去を 救い出すための時間よ
Oh time, meant for rescuing a fading past,

397
00:54:39,906 --> 00:54:49,006
ここから始まれ
start from right here!

398
00:54:49,506 --> 00:54:54,306
巡りゆく一瞬を 今一度きりの願いへ
A passing moment toward a one-time wish right now,

399
00:54:54,706 --> 00:54:59,406
確かに僕は 託された
I was surely entrusted with it.

400
00:54:59,706 --> 00:55:05,106
いつかの約束 光の道しるべになる
That promise someday will become a guiding light.

401
00:55:05,094 --> 00:55:06,394
誓いを
A vow,

402
00:55:06,394 --> 00:55:08,594
さあ 君のため
now, for your sake,

403
00:55:08,594 --> 00:55:11,894
最期まで
until the very end,

404
00:55:11,894 --> 00:55:16,894
涙さえ力に変えてきっと
I'll turn even my tears into strength and surely

405
00:55:16,894 --> 00:55:21,894
描いていた望む未来へ
connect to the desired future I envisioned,

406
00:55:21,894 --> 00:55:24,394
繋ぐよ
I'll link them!

407
00:55:39,594 --> 00:55:42,394
はい！
Yeah!

408
00:55:42,394 --> 00:55:46,094
ということで 来ていただいてありがとうございます！
So, thank you so much for coming today!

409
00:55:46,094 --> 00:55:48,094
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

410
00:55:48,094 --> 00:55:53,594
今日は小悪魔衣装になって 魔法で召喚されちゃいました！
Today I put on a little devil outfit and got summoned with magic!

411
00:55:53,594 --> 00:55:56,294
召喚されちゃいました！小あずき！
I was summoned! Ko-AZKi!

412
00:55:56,294 --> 00:55:57,494
ありがとう！
Aw, thank you!

413
00:55:57,494 --> 00:56:02,094
ということでね 皆さんもご存知だと思いますが
So, as I'm sure everyone already knows,

414
00:56:02,094 --> 00:56:07,094
アニソン界のエース 鈴木このみさんに異世界転生してもらいました！
we had the ace of the anison world, Konomi Suzuki-san, reincarnate into our world!

415
00:56:07,094 --> 00:56:09,094
召喚されましたー！
I was summoned!

416
00:56:09,094 --> 00:56:12,594
誕生日をね 今日はお祝いしたいなと思って参りました！
I came here today wanting to celebrate your birthday!

417
00:56:12,594 --> 00:56:16,294
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

418
00:56:16,294 --> 00:56:20,594
ということでですね 一緒に歌った曲は『Re:ゼロから始める異世界生活』の
So, the song we just sang together was from "Re:Zero - Starting Life in Another World,"

419
00:56:20,594 --> 00:56:26,094
ファーストシーズンオープニングテーマ『Redo』でした！
the Season 1 opening theme, "Redo"!

420
00:56:26,094 --> 00:56:28,094
いかがでしたか？
How was it?

421
00:56:28,094 --> 00:56:30,094
ドキドキしたなー！
My heart was pounding!

422
00:56:30,094 --> 00:56:32,294
いや 私もめっちゃドキドキした！
Mine was pounding like crazy too!

423
00:56:32,294 --> 00:56:36,094
なんか『Redo』を人と歌ったことがあんまりなくて
I've rarely sung "Redo" with anyone else before,

424
00:56:36,094 --> 00:56:40,094
あんまり怖い顔をして歌ってないかすごい心配です
so I was really worried if I was making a scary face while singing.

425
00:56:40,094 --> 00:56:43,094
貴重な... 貴重な経験ありがとうございます！
Thank you for such a precious... precious experience!

426
00:56:43,094 --> 00:56:45,094
AZKiちゃんと歌えて楽しかった！
It was so much fun singing with AZKi-chan!

427
00:56:45,094 --> 00:56:48,094
「あずきち」って呼んでくれてるんですよ 皆さん！
She calls me "AZUkichi", everyone!

428
00:56:48,094 --> 00:56:51,094
AZKiはね「このみん」って呼んでるんですけど
And AZKi calls her "Konomin"!

429
00:56:51,094 --> 00:56:54,094
いや そう 実はね 出会いのきっかけはですね
Yeah, so actually, how we first met was...

430
00:56:54,094 --> 00:56:57,594
いや もうずっとAZKiは元々大好きなんですけど
Well, AZKi has always loved her to begin with,

431
00:56:57,594 --> 00:57:01,594
このみんがね あの『異世界かるてっと』の...
but Konomin was doing "Isekai Quartet"...

432
00:57:01,594 --> 00:57:05,594
そうそう！『異世界かるてっと3』のエンディングテーマ...
Right, right! The ending theme for "Isekai Quartet 3"...

433
00:57:05,594 --> 00:57:09,594
『キミイロボクイロ』のカルテットバージョンを作ることになりまして
We were making the quartet version of "Kimi-iro Boku-iro,"

434
00:57:09,594 --> 00:57:13,094
で その時に会社の人から「誰か1人好きな人を召喚できる権利を差し上げます」って
and someone from my company said, "We'll grant you the right to summon one person you like!"

435
00:57:13,094 --> 00:57:18,094
言われて...「はっ！そんな機会あるなら あずきちにお願いしてみたい」って
So I thought, "Ah! If I have that chance, I want to ask AZUkichi!"

436
00:57:18,094 --> 00:57:24,094
私 ライブ元々見てたんで！
Because I'd been watching her live shows from the beginning!

437
00:57:24,094 --> 00:57:25,594
えー！嬉しい！いいんですか？
Eh~! I'm so happy! Is that really okay?

438
00:57:25,594 --> 00:57:29,594
いつかコラボしたいなーっていう気持ちがずっとあったので
I always had this feeling that I wanted to collaborate with her someday,

439
00:57:29,594 --> 00:57:33,094
そこでラブコールをして 叶いまして！
so I sent her a love call, and it came true!

440
00:57:33,094 --> 00:57:35,594
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

441
00:57:35,594 --> 00:57:38,294
まさかね そんなことがありまして
To think that happened, and from there...

442
00:57:38,294 --> 00:57:42,094
そこからコラボ配信とか
...we did collaboration streams,

443
00:57:42,094 --> 00:57:46,094
AZKiもね このみんのライブ見に行かせてもらったりとか
and AZKi even got to go watch Konomin's live concerts...

444
00:57:46,094 --> 00:57:47,294
ありがとう！
Thank you!

445
00:57:47,294 --> 00:57:50,094
あとはね ラーメンの...
And then, with ramen...

446
00:57:50,094 --> 00:57:53,894
ラーメンのスープをね 飛ばしました！
We splashed ramen soup on ourselves!

447
00:57:53,894 --> 00:57:56,594
配信の日にそういう話をしていて
We were talking about that on stream,

448
00:57:56,594 --> 00:57:59,594
すぐLINEを交換して
and immediately exchanged LINE contacts,

449
00:57:59,594 --> 00:58:02,894
すぐラーメンのスープを飛ばして
and immediately splashed ramen soup!

450
00:58:02,894 --> 00:58:05,894
すぐそのあと焼肉にも行って
Right after that, we went for Korean BBQ,

451
00:58:05,894 --> 00:58:09,594
油を飛ばして...
and splashed grease...

452
00:58:09,594 --> 00:58:12,094
アフタヌーンティーにも行きました！
We also went for afternoon tea!

453
00:58:12,094 --> 00:58:15,594
一応おしゃれなことも... 親しい... 結構ね！
We did stylish things too... we've gotten pretty close!

454
00:58:15,594 --> 00:58:17,594
そうなんです！よく会ってるよね 最近！
That's right! We've been meeting up a lot lately, right?

455
00:58:17,594 --> 00:58:20,594
なんと仲良くさせていただいております！
We've actually become really good friends!

456
00:58:20,594 --> 00:58:24,094
濃厚なお付き合いをさせてもらっておりまして
We've been spending a lot of quality time together,

457
00:58:24,094 --> 00:58:27,094
なんと今日！ついに！
and today, finally!

458
00:58:27,094 --> 00:58:30,094
バーチャル空間に来てくれましたー！
She came into the virtual space!

459
00:58:30,094 --> 00:58:32,894
初めてです！ありがとうー！
It's my first time! Thank you!

460
00:58:32,894 --> 00:58:34,894
なんて楽しい空間なんだ！
What a fun space this is!

461
00:58:34,894 --> 00:58:37,294
嬉しすぎるー！
I'm so happy!

462
00:58:37,294 --> 00:58:41,594
嬉しい！なんかこの空間は魔法が使えるって聞いたんですけど 本当ですか？
I'm so happy! I heard you can use magic in this space, is that true?

463
00:58:41,594 --> 00:58:43,894
使っちゃいます？このみんは一体どんな魔法を...
Wanna try using it? What kind of magic does Konomin...

464
00:58:43,894 --> 00:58:47,094
私 も僭越ながら 1つだけ魔法を覚えてきたんですよ！
Humbly enough, I learned just one magic spell for today!

465
00:58:47,094 --> 00:58:51,594
なんと！この日のために！これだけ使える！
What! For this day! This is the only one I can use!

466
00:58:51,594 --> 00:58:58,094
これはでも みんなと一緒じゃないと完成しない魔法なんで
But this magic won't be complete unless everyone joins in,

467
00:58:58,094 --> 00:59:00,294
ぜひあずきちへのラブを込めて
so with lots of love for AZUkichi,

468
00:59:00,294 --> 00:59:02,094
何ですか？
What is it?

469
00:59:02,094 --> 00:59:05,094
一緒に歌って魔法を完成させてください！
please sing along with me to complete the spell!

470
00:59:05,094 --> 00:59:06,094
せーの！
Ready, set, go!

471
00:59:06,094 --> 00:59:09,294
Happy birthday to you

472
00:59:09,294 --> 00:59:13,094
Happy birthday to you

473
00:59:13,094 --> 00:59:17,894
Happy birthday dear あずきち
Happy birthday dear AZUkichi

474
00:59:17,894 --> 00:59:21,894
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

475
00:59:21,894 --> 00:59:27,594
Happy birthday to you

476
00:59:27,594 --> 00:59:30,894
あずきち 仕上げをお願いします！
AZUkichi, please do the finishing touch!

477
00:59:30,894 --> 00:59:34,894
はい！ふーっ！
Okay!

478
00:59:37,094 --> 00:59:41,094
このみんは炎の使い手でした！
Konomin was a flame wielder!

479
00:59:41,094 --> 00:59:44,094
おめでとうございます！
Happy Birthday!

480
00:59:44,094 --> 00:59:49,094
ありがとうございます！まさか歌までプレゼントしていただけるなんて...
Thank you so much! To think you'd even give me a song as a gift...

481
00:59:49,094 --> 00:59:52,094
もう ここで命尽きても...
Ah, even if my life ends right here...

482
00:59:52,094 --> 00:59:56,094
待って待って！ダメです！命尽きちゃダメなんです！
Wait, wait! No! You can't let your life end!

483
00:59:56,094 --> 01:00:00,094
実は 皆さん 今日重大告知と...
Actually, everyone, today we have a major announcement and...

484
01:00:00,130 --> 01:00:02,230
書いてあると思うんですけどね サムネに
I think it's already written on the thumbnail, though.

485
01:00:02,230 --> 01:00:06,330
2人から重大告知がございます！
We have a major announcement from the two of us!

486
01:00:06,330 --> 01:00:07,530
やったー！
Yay!

487
01:00:07,530 --> 01:00:12,730
なんと！2人のオリジナルコラボ楽曲が出ます！
We're releasing an original collaboration song!

488
01:00:12,730 --> 01:00:19,530
やったー！嬉しい！えー！いいんですか？
Yay! I'm so happy! Wow! Is this really happening?

489
01:00:19,530 --> 01:00:26,630
ということでタイトルは... せーの！「最強未来衝動」！
So, the title is... ready, set, "Saikyou Mirai Shoudou"!

490
01:00:26,630 --> 01:00:32,130
という なんだか強そうなタイトルですね 強い曲ですね！
That sounds like a powerful title. It's a high-energy song!

491
01:00:32,130 --> 01:00:37,430
ということで なんと！今日 初披露させていただきます！
And today, we will be performing it for the very first time!

492
01:00:37,430 --> 01:00:43,130
それでは早速聴いてもらえますか？
So without further ado, would you like to hear it?

493
01:00:43,130 --> 01:00:48,630
それでは聴いてください！
Please enjoy!

494
01:01:06,130 --> 01:01:08,430
だから JUST FLY TO THE STAR
So, JUST FLY TO THE STAR

495
01:01:08,430 --> 01:01:10,030
もっと WOW WOW
More, WOW WOW

496
01:01:10,030 --> 01:01:12,130
世界中で PROUDY GLOW
PROUDY GLOW all over the world

497
01:01:12,130 --> 01:01:15,330
存在など 歌い切って 無い 無い
Sing until there's nothing left of our existence

498
01:01:15,330 --> 01:01:18,130
壊れても 関係ない
Even if we break, it doesn't matter

499
01:01:31,130 --> 01:01:36,630
そっと触れるよ 生まれたての星へ
Softly touching a newborn star

500
01:01:36,630 --> 01:01:42,130
囁きながら 願い重ねた 宇宙
Whispering our overlapping wishes into the universe

501
01:01:42,130 --> 01:01:47,130
ほどけた軌道は 誰も知らない場所へ
Unraveling orbits lead to an unknown place

502
01:01:47,130 --> 01:01:53,130
微かな記憶と夢を この声に込めて
Pouring faint memories and dreams into this voice

503
01:01:53,130 --> 01:01:56,130
今を 過去を
The present, the past...

504
01:01:56,130 --> 01:01:59,130
未来を辿る
...tracing into the future.

505
01:01:59,130 --> 01:02:01,630
一瞬を 一生を
A single moment, a whole lifetime...

506
01:02:01,630 --> 01:02:04,330
この手で掴む
...grasping it with these hands!

507
01:02:04,330 --> 01:02:06,330
超 BIG BANG!
Super BIG BANG!

508
01:02:06,330 --> 01:02:08,930
ただこのまま果てまで
Just going like this to the end...

509
01:02:08,930 --> 01:02:11,130
溶けちゃって
...melting away.

510
01:02:11,130 --> 01:02:14,130
切り裂かれたような衝動
An impulse like being torn apart.

511
01:02:14,130 --> 01:02:17,330
抱かれて 染まって 振り切って
Embraced, dyed, and breaking free!

512
01:02:17,330 --> 01:02:19,130
まだ まだ ほら また
Not yet, not yet, see, once more...

513
01:02:19,130 --> 01:02:22,130
星を 締め付ける
...constricting the stars.

514
01:02:22,130 --> 01:02:25,130
君と絡まってみようか
Shall I become intertwined with you?

515
01:02:25,130 --> 01:02:28,130
止まらないよ 最強未来衝動
It won't stop, the ultimate future impulse!

516
01:02:28,130 --> 01:02:30,630
ただ ただ ただ ただ
Just, just, just, just...

517
01:02:30,630 --> 01:02:33,330
剥がれ落ちてく
...peeling away and falling.

518
01:02:33,330 --> 01:02:38,930
広がって 咲いて 駆け出して 飛んで
Spreading out, blooming, running forth, flying!

519
01:02:38,930 --> 01:02:41,630
君と JUST FLY TO THE STAR
With you, JUST FLY TO THE STAR

520
01:02:41,630 --> 01:02:42,930
もっと WOW WOW
More, WOW WOW

521
01:02:42,930 --> 01:02:45,130
無重力で DREAMY SHOW
In zero gravity, a DREAMY SHOW

522
01:02:45,130 --> 01:02:48,130
運命など 待ちきれない 無い
We can't wait for destiny, no, no!

523
01:02:48,130 --> 01:02:51,130
壊れても 関係ない
Even if we break, it doesn't matter!

524
01:02:56,130 --> 01:03:01,330
そっと祈るよ 幾千年の星へ
Softly praying to stars of thousands of years

525
01:03:01,330 --> 01:03:06,630
彷徨いながら 僕ら出会えたんだ
While wandering, we managed to find each other

526
01:03:06,630 --> 01:03:11,930
燃え尽きる前に 誰しも彼しも急ぐよ
Before burning out, everyone rushes on

527
01:03:11,930 --> 01:03:17,930
確かな希望と信念を この声に込めて
Pouring certain hope and conviction into this voice

528
01:03:17,930 --> 01:03:20,930
星よ 光れ
Oh star, shine bright

529
01:03:20,930 --> 01:03:23,330
闇を照らせ
Illuminate the darkness

530
01:03:23,330 --> 01:03:26,330
歌よ 響け
Oh song, resound

531
01:03:26,330 --> 01:03:28,930
遥か彼方へ
Far into the distance

532
01:03:28,930 --> 01:03:31,130
超 BIG BANG!
Super BIG BANG!

533
01:03:31,130 --> 01:03:33,930
引力にさあ 導かれ
Guided now by gravity

534
01:03:33,930 --> 01:03:36,930
この手を繋いだら
If we hold these hands together...

535
01:03:36,930 --> 01:03:38,930
それだけでいい
...that is all we need.

536
01:03:38,930 --> 01:03:41,930
聞いて! 鳴り止まない絶唱
Listen! An unending passionate song

537
01:03:41,930 --> 01:03:44,930
愛して 焦がして 振り切って
Loving, yearning, breaking through

538
01:03:44,930 --> 01:03:46,930
まだ まだ ほら また
Not yet, not yet, see, once more...

539
01:03:46,930 --> 01:03:49,930
宇宙を 駆け巡る
...racing across the universe.

540
01:03:49,930 --> 01:03:52,930
君を狂わせてみようか
Shall I drive you wild?

541
01:03:52,930 --> 01:03:55,930
止まらないで 絶対未来衝動
Don't stop, absolute future impulse!

542
01:03:55,930 --> 01:03:58,330
ただ ただ ただ ただ
Just, just, just, just...

543
01:03:58,330 --> 01:04:00,930
生まれ落ちてく
...being born and falling.

544
01:04:00,930 --> 01:04:06,630
そばにいて 触れて 輝いて 消えて
Stay by my side, touch me, shine bright, fade away

545
01:04:18,130 --> 01:04:21,130
生きることは
Living is...

546
01:04:21,130 --> 01:04:28,330
銀河を旅する STORY
...a STORY of traveling through the galaxy.

547
01:04:28,330 --> 01:04:31,130
どこまでも 走っていく
Running forever onwards!

548
01:04:31,130 --> 01:04:34,130
どこまでも 燃やしていく
Burning bright forever onwards!

549
01:04:34,130 --> 01:04:39,130
どこまでも 生命がある限り
As long as there is life within us!

550
01:04:39,130 --> 01:04:42,630
叫べ
Shout!

551
01:05:00,130 --> 01:05:03,130
伝えたい この淡い衝動
I want to convey this faint impulse

552
01:05:03,130 --> 01:05:04,130
伝えたい この熱い衝動を
I want to convey this burning impulse

553
01:05:05,118 --> 01:05:06,418
伝えたい この熱い衝動を
I want to convey this passionate impulse

554
01:05:06,418 --> 01:05:07,218
走れ
Run!

555
01:05:07,218 --> 01:05:08,118
You can

556
01:05:08,118 --> 01:05:09,118
ここから
From here,

557
01:05:09,118 --> 01:05:11,118
次元を超えていく
we'll transcend dimensions.

558
01:05:11,118 --> 01:05:12,618
超えていく
Transcending them,

559
01:05:12,618 --> 01:05:15,118
超えていく...
transcending...

560
01:05:15,118 --> 01:05:18,618
歌え！この衝動はきっと
Sing! This impulse will surely

561
01:05:18,618 --> 01:05:22,618
抱かれて 染まって 振り切って
be embraced, dyed, and broken free of.

562
01:05:22,618 --> 01:05:24,118
まだ まだ ほら
Not yet, not yet, look!

563
01:05:24,118 --> 01:05:27,618
また 星を締め付ける
It grips the stars once again.

564
01:05:27,618 --> 01:05:30,318
君と絡まってみようか
Shall we become intertwined with you?

565
01:05:30,318 --> 01:05:33,618
止まらないよ 最強未来衝動
It won't stop—the ultimate future impulse.

566
01:05:33,618 --> 01:05:35,118
ただ ただ ただ
Just, just, just...

567
01:05:35,118 --> 01:05:38,618
剥がれ落ちていく
peeling away.

568
01:05:38,618 --> 01:05:43,918
広がって 再生 駆け出して 飛んで
Spreading out, regenerating, running out, and flying!

569
01:05:43,918 --> 01:05:47,618
だから JUST FLY TO THE STAR もっと WOW WOW
So JUST FLY TO THE STAR, even more WOW WOW!

570
01:05:47,618 --> 01:05:50,418
世界中で PROUDY GLOW
PROUDLY GLOWing all over the world!

571
01:05:50,418 --> 01:05:53,118
存在など言い切って無い 無い
There's no saying what existence even is, no, no!

572
01:05:53,118 --> 01:05:56,118
壊れても関係ない
Even if it breaks, it doesn't matter!

573
01:06:07,618 --> 01:06:14,118
はーい！ということで新曲を披露させていただきました！
Yay! And with that, we've just performed our new song!

574
01:06:14,118 --> 01:06:15,318
ありがとうございました！
Thank you so much!

575
01:06:15,318 --> 01:06:18,618
ありがとうございます！かっこいい曲になりましたね、このみん！
Thank you! It turned into such a cool song, Konomin!

576
01:06:18,618 --> 01:06:20,618
えー曲！えー曲！
Such a great song! A great song!

577
01:06:21,918 --> 01:06:27,918
ということでですね、「最強未来衝動」、本日この後7月2日0時からデジタルリリースされます！
So, "Saikyou Mirai Shoudou" will be released digitally starting at midnight today, July 2nd!

578
01:06:33,118 --> 01:06:35,118
ちょっとせっかくなので...
Since we're here...

579
01:06:35,118 --> 01:06:36,618
この曲、実は...
This song, actually...

580
01:06:36,618 --> 01:06:39,918
2人で作詞を...
...the two of us wrote the lyrics...

581
01:06:39,918 --> 01:06:41,618
そうなんですよ！
That's right!

582
01:06:41,618 --> 01:06:42,618
いたしました！
...together!

583
01:06:42,618 --> 01:06:45,118
2日間一緒に缶詰状態になって...
For two days, we were cooped up together...

584
01:06:45,118 --> 01:06:48,118
部屋に閉じこもってね...
...locked inside a room...

585
01:06:48,118 --> 01:06:55,618
このみんと一緒に作詞をするという、大変貴重な体験をさせていただきました。
...and I had a very valuable experience writing lyrics together with Konomin.

586
01:06:55,618 --> 01:07:00,118
私もすごい楽しかったし、仲も深まったんじゃないかって...
For me too, it was so much fun, and I feel like our bond deepened...

587
01:07:00,118 --> 01:07:02,918
そう！仲が深まったんじゃないか...
Yes! I feel like our bond deepened...

588
01:07:02,918 --> 01:07:05,118
...気がしております。
...I really feel that way.

589
01:07:05,118 --> 01:07:13,318
嬉しいです！そんな楽曲ですので、ぜひぜひ隅々まで聴いてほしいなと思います！
I'm so happy! Since it's a song like that, I really hope you listen to every detail!

590
01:07:13,318 --> 01:07:14,618
お願いします！
Please do!

591
01:07:14,618 --> 01:07:19,618
というわけで、今日はこの世界に来てくれてありがとうございました！
And so, thank you so much for coming to this world today!

592
01:07:19,618 --> 01:07:21,918
ありがとうございました！どうでしたか？
Thank you so much! How was it?

593
01:07:21,918 --> 01:07:26,118
正直言っていい？めっちゃ楽しい！
Can I be honest? It was super fun!

594
01:07:26,118 --> 01:07:28,118
なんか巡動してる...
I feel so energized...

595
01:07:28,118 --> 01:07:31,618
何でも炎とか出せちゃうんだって...
Like we could even shoot out flames and stuff...

596
01:07:31,618 --> 01:07:33,318
そう、炎も出せちゃうし！
Yeah, we can shoot out flames!

597
01:07:33,318 --> 01:07:34,918
最高！
Awesome!

598
01:07:34,918 --> 01:07:38,318
最後に2人でこのハートマークを作りませんか？
At the end, shall the two of us make a heart shape together?

599
01:07:38,318 --> 01:07:39,618
やりたーい！
I wanna do it!

600
01:07:39,618 --> 01:07:41,618
じゃあ行くよ！せーの！
Alright, here we go! Ready, set...

601
01:07:41,618 --> 01:07:43,118
はい！
...there!

602
01:07:45,618 --> 01:07:47,118
いいんじゃないでしょうか！
Isn't this great?!

603
01:07:47,118 --> 01:07:50,118
いいね！みんな撮れた？スクショお願いしますね。
Nice! Did everyone get it? Please take screenshots!

604
01:07:50,118 --> 01:07:54,118
はい！ということでこのみんと一緒にハートを作ったところで...
Alright! Now that we've made a heart together with Konomin...

605
01:07:54,118 --> 01:07:59,118
最後にこのみんから告知などありますか？ぜひ！
...finally, Konomin, do you have any announcements? Please!

606
01:07:59,118 --> 01:08:03,118
はい！まず7月11日にアニサマ！
Yes! First, on July 11th, Anisama!

607
01:08:03,118 --> 01:08:07,618
夏のアニメの祭典が行われます！
The summer anime festival will take place!

608
01:08:07,618 --> 01:08:09,618
そちらに出ます！
I'll be performing there!

609
01:08:09,618 --> 01:08:11,118
すごいすごいすごい！
Amazing, amazing, amazing!

610
01:08:11,118 --> 01:08:13,618
フェスモードな感じで、アニソンですよね。
With a festival vibe, singing anime songs!

611
01:08:13,618 --> 01:08:15,118
アチチな...
Super hot...

612
01:08:15,118 --> 01:08:18,118
歌で炎バンバン出せたらいいなと...
I hope we can shoot out flames with our songs...

613
01:08:18,118 --> 01:08:20,618
...思いますので、現実でも炎を出してくれます。
...so I'll make sure to bring the heat in reality too!

614
01:08:20,618 --> 01:08:21,918
お願いします！
Please do!

615
01:08:21,918 --> 01:08:25,118
あとはライブが決まってまして...
Also, I have a live concert coming up...

616
01:08:25,118 --> 01:08:33,118
11月7日土曜日に東京SGCホールにて、「アニソンコレクションプラス」アニソンだけを歌うライブをやります！
...on Saturday, November 7th at Tokyo SGC Hall, "Anisong Collection Plus," where I'll only sing anime songs!

617
01:08:33,118 --> 01:08:34,918
なんですってー！
What did you say?!

618
01:08:34,918 --> 01:08:41,118
だから今日あずきちがアニソンずっと歌ってて...
So today AZKichi was singing anime songs all day...

619
01:08:41,118 --> 01:08:44,118
そうなんです、今日アニソンをテーマにしたライブとなっております。
That's right, today's live is themed around anime songs.

620
01:08:44,118 --> 01:08:46,618
ちょっと先取りじゃんって思いながら...
I was thinking, "Ah, she's doing it before me!"...

621
01:08:46,618 --> 01:08:47,918
...ありがとうございます！
...thank you!

622
01:08:47,918 --> 01:08:50,318
私もそんな1日を過ごそうかなと。
I plan to spend a day like that too.

623
01:08:50,318 --> 01:08:51,918
応援してます！
I'm rooting for you!

624
01:08:51,918 --> 01:08:56,118
代表曲ばっかり流れる、そんな...
It'll be packed with iconic songs...

625
01:08:56,118 --> 01:08:57,618
そんなー、行かなきゃ！
No way, I gotta go!

626
01:08:57,618 --> 01:08:59,118
ぜひ来てほしい！
I really want you to come!

627
01:08:59,118 --> 01:09:00,618
行かなきゃ！ぜひぜひ！
I gotta go! Definitely!

628
01:09:00,618 --> 01:09:08,118
ということで、詳しくはアカウントをチェックしていただいて、一緒にアニソンまみれの1日を過ごしましょう！
So please check my official account for details, and let's spend a day covered in anime songs together!

629
01:09:08,118 --> 01:09:10,118
よろしくお願いします！
Thank you!

630
01:09:10,118 --> 01:09:13,618
はい！ということで...
Alright! And so...

631
01:09:13,618 --> 01:09:20,118
寂しいんですが、そろそろこのみんを元の世界に戻さないと、アニサマも...
It's sad, but I need to send Konomin back to her original world soon, or else Anisama...

632
01:09:20,118 --> 01:09:22,618
...アニソンコレクションもできないので...
...and Anisong Collection won't happen either!

633
01:09:22,618 --> 01:09:24,618
またご飯行こう！
Let's go eat out again!

634
01:09:24,618 --> 01:09:26,118
ご飯行こう！
Let's go eat out!

635
01:09:26,118 --> 01:09:28,118
行こう行こう！やったー！
Let me go, let's go! Yay!

636
01:09:28,118 --> 01:09:35,918
じゃあ魔法を使ってこのみんを元の世界に戻したいと思います！今日はありがとうございました！
So I'll use magic to return Konomin to her original world! Thank you so much for today!

637
01:09:35,918 --> 01:09:38,118
ありがとうございました！おめでとう！
Thank you so much! Congratulations!

638
01:09:38,118 --> 01:09:41,118
ありがとうー！
Thank you!

639
01:09:44,118 --> 01:09:47,118
あー、消えちゃった...
Ah, she disappeared...

640
01:09:47,118 --> 01:09:57,118
はい！ということでですね、サプライズスペシャルゲスト、鈴木このみさんに来ていただきました！
Alright! So, surprise special guest Konomi Suzuki came to join us!

641
01:09:57,118 --> 01:10:00,118
今日のライブ、いかがでしたでしょうか！
How was today's live concert?!

642
01:10:00,154 --> 01:10:02,754
豪華、本当にね、内容盛りだくさんで。
It was truly lavish and filled with content,

643
01:10:02,754 --> 01:10:04,054
そうだ！
Oh right!

644
01:10:04,054 --> 01:10:08,654
このね、新しい小悪魔な衣装のこと、あんまり話せなかったので、
I couldn't really talk much about this new little devil outfit earlier,

645
01:10:08,654 --> 01:10:13,354
この後、メン限でゆっくり見てもらえたらと思います。
so I hope you'll take your time to look at it during the members-only stream after this.

646
01:10:13,354 --> 01:10:17,654
実は、いろんなアクセサリーや差分があります！ということで、
Actually, there are various accessories and variations! So with that,

647
01:10:17,654 --> 01:10:21,954
ぜひメン限もよろしくお願いします！
please look forward to the members-only stream as well!

648
01:10:21,954 --> 01:10:23,654
そして、皆様！
And now, everyone!

649
01:10:23,654 --> 01:10:25,354
最後に
Lastly,

650
01:10:25,354 --> 01:10:27,354
AZKiから
AZKi has

651
01:10:27,354 --> 01:10:28,354
みんなに
some happy news

652
01:10:28,354 --> 01:10:30,354
嬉しいお知らせです！
to share with everyone!

653
01:10:30,354 --> 01:10:33,654
こちらをどうぞー！
Please check this out!

654
01:10:47,654 --> 01:10:52,154
傷ついた感情も 連れていくから
I'll take along these hurt emotions, too,

655
01:10:52,154 --> 01:10:57,354
そっと響くファンファーレが 新しい未来を感じてる
as the softly echoing fanfare makes me feel a new future.

656
01:10:57,354 --> 01:11:03,354
怖くたって 進むしかないでしょ 遠くまで
Even if I'm scared, I have no choice but to go forward, far away!

657
01:11:03,354 --> 01:11:07,954
届くかな 祈りよ 光となれ
Will it reach? May my prayers turn into light,

658
01:11:07,954 --> 01:11:14,354
もっと もっと 少しずつでもいい
more and more, even if it's little by little,

659
01:11:14,354 --> 01:11:21,154
優しさという答えを
an answer called kindness.

660
01:11:21,154 --> 01:11:28,654
もっと... もっと...
More... more...

661
01:11:38,954 --> 01:11:40,654
お待たせしました！
Thank you for waiting!

662
01:11:40,654 --> 01:11:45,954
AZKi Solo Live 2025『Departure』Blu-ray発売決定！
AZKi Solo Live 2025 "Departure" Blu-ray release confirmed!

663
01:11:45,954 --> 01:11:51,354
開拓者のみんなと紡いだあのステージが
That stage we created together with all the Pioneers

664
01:11:51,354 --> 01:11:53,954
何度でも見返せます！
can now be rewatched over and over again!

665
01:11:53,954 --> 01:11:57,154
本日より受注受付が開始です！
Pre-orders start today!

666
01:11:57,154 --> 01:11:59,154
続いて、告知2つ目！
Moving on to the second announcement!

667
01:11:59,154 --> 01:12:01,154
AZKiの歴史を彩る
Coloring the history of AZKi,

668
01:12:01,154 --> 01:12:05,654
EP2作品の再販が、本日7月1日より全国流通スタート！
the re-release of two EP albums begins nationwide distribution today, July 1st!

669
01:12:05,654 --> 01:12:11,154
対象タイトルは『Without U』と『Re:Creating world』です！
The eligible titles are "Without U" and "Re:Creating world"!

670
01:12:11,154 --> 01:12:13,654
最後！告知3つ目！
Finally, announcement number three!

671
01:12:13,654 --> 01:12:18,154
AZKi誕生日記念2026グッズ情報！
AZKi Birthday Commemoration 2026 merchandise info!

672
01:12:18,154 --> 01:12:23,954
今回はお披露目された小悪魔衣装にちなんだグッズが盛りだくさんです！
This time, there's a packed lineup of merch themed after the newly revealed little devil outfit!

673
01:12:23,954 --> 01:12:28,154
イラストは信澤収先生に描いていただきました！
The illustrations were drawn by Nobusawa Osamu-sensei!

674
01:12:28,154 --> 01:12:29,954
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

675
01:12:29,954 --> 01:12:32,154
それでは詳細を見ていきましょう！
Now, let's check out the details!

676
01:12:32,154 --> 01:12:33,954
まずはこちら！
First up is this!

677
01:12:33,954 --> 01:12:35,654
2層アクリルパネル！
2-Layer Acrylic Panel!

678
01:12:35,654 --> 01:12:39,154
小悪魔衣装のキービジュアルをアクリルパネルにしました！
We turned the key visual of the little devil outfit into an acrylic panel!

679
01:12:39,154 --> 01:12:42,154
2層になっているので立体的に見えます！
Because it's 2-layered, it looks three-dimensional!

680
01:12:42,154 --> 01:12:48,954
ステンドグラスの神秘的な美しさと小悪魔衣装が見せるギャップを楽しんでください！
Please enjoy the contrast between the stained glass's mystical beauty and the little devil outfit!

681
01:12:48,954 --> 01:12:50,654
続いてはこちら！
Next up is this!

682
01:12:50,654 --> 01:12:53,154
ランダムラバーキーホルダー！
Random Rubber Keychain!

683
01:12:53,154 --> 01:12:56,654
この後のメン限でも詳しく見せちゃうんですけど、
I'll show them in detail during the members-only stream after this,

684
01:12:56,654 --> 01:13:02,654
今回の新衣装、実はバリエーションがいっぱいあるのでラバーキーホルダーにしてもらいました！
but this new outfit actually has lots of variations, so we turned them into rubber keychains!

685
01:13:02,654 --> 01:13:05,654
君のお気に入りはどのAZKiかな？
Which AZKi is your favorite?

686
01:13:05,654 --> 01:13:09,654
イラストは、にゃとら先生に描いていただきました！
The illustrations were drawn by Nyatora-sensei!

687
01:13:09,654 --> 01:13:11,354
続いてはこちら！
Next up is this!

688
01:13:11,354 --> 01:13:13,354
ぬいぐるみキーホルダー！
Plushie Keychain!

689
01:13:13,354 --> 01:13:16,654
こちらも小悪魔衣装バージョンとなってます！
This one is also the little devil outfit version!

690
01:13:16,654 --> 01:13:23,154
使い魔みたいなちゃめっ気のある表情になっているので、ぜひ相棒として連れ歩いてください！
It has a playful expression like a familiar, so please take it along as your companion!

691
01:13:23,154 --> 01:13:25,154
続いてはこちら！
Next up is this!

692
01:13:25,154 --> 01:13:27,354
おそろいブレスレット！
Matching Bracelet!

693
01:13:27,354 --> 01:13:31,154
小悪魔衣装をモチーフにしたデザインのブレスレットです！
This bracelet design is themed after the little devil outfit!

694
01:13:31,154 --> 01:13:35,154
日常の中でさりげなく推しを身に纏えるのはもちろん、
You can casually wear your favorite idol in daily life, of course,

695
01:13:35,154 --> 01:13:41,654
普段アクセサリーをつけない方には新衣装の再現コレクションとしてもおすすめのグッズです！
and for those who don't usually wear accessories, it's also recommended as a replica item of the new outfit!

696
01:13:41,654 --> 01:13:43,354
続いてはこちら！
Next up is this!

697
01:13:43,354 --> 01:13:45,354
ASMRボイス！
ASMR Voice!

698
01:13:45,354 --> 01:13:48,954
ボイスタイトルは『小悪魔チャーミング』！
The voice track title is "Little Devil Charming"!

699
01:13:48,954 --> 01:13:55,654
AZKiが小悪魔っぽく魔法をかけちゃう？そんなもしものお話のASMRボイスです！
What if AZKi casts a spell like a little devil? It's an ASMR voice track of that "what if" story!

700
01:13:55,654 --> 01:13:59,154
そして、フルセット購入特典もございます！
And there's also a Full Set Purchase Bonus!

701
01:13:59,154 --> 01:14:05,654
信澤収先生イラストのAZKiのタロット風カードと特典ASMRボイスです！
It's an AZKi tarot-style card illustrated by Nobusawa Osamu-sensei and a bonus ASMR voice!

702
01:14:05,654 --> 01:14:11,154
数量限定バージョンは、直筆サイン＆箔押し複製メッセージ入りです！
The limited quantity version comes with a handwritten signature & foil-stamped message copy!

703
01:14:11,154 --> 01:14:15,654
通常バージョンは、箔押し複製サイン＆メッセージ入りです！
The standard version comes with a foil-stamped signature copy & message!

704
01:14:15,654 --> 01:14:19,154
ということで、以上、嬉しいお知らせでした！
And so, that was all the happy announcements!

705
01:14:19,154 --> 01:14:22,654
この後は、メン限でアンコールライブ！
After this, we'll have an encore live stream for members!

706
01:14:22,654 --> 01:14:28,154
まだメン限に入っていない方も、まだ間に合うのでぜひ入ってみてください！
Even if you haven't joined the membership yet, there's still time, so please check it out!

707
01:14:28,154 --> 01:14:37,954
実は今回の新衣装、みんなにまだ見せていないあんな姿やこんな姿があるので、見に来てくれたら嬉しいです！
Actually, for this new outfit, there are looks I haven't shown everyone yet, so I'd be happy if you came to see!

708
01:14:37,954 --> 01:14:43,954
誕生日たくさんお祝いしてくれてありがとう！ライブも見てくれてありがとう！
Thank you so much for all the birthday wishes! Thank you for watching the live stream!

709
01:14:43,954 --> 01:14:47,154
それじゃあ、この後メン限で会おうね！バイバイ！
Well then, see you in the members-only stream after this! Bye-bye!

